#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:26
msgid "SQD scaling tutorial. Each space has its own Hamiltonian and reference"
msgstr "SQD 规模扩展教程。每个活性空间都有独立的哈密顿量和参考计算"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:56
msgid ""
"The full H3O+ STO-3G space is larger than the default examples. The public H3O+ scripts therefore"
" use conservative active-space and Trotter settings."
msgstr "完整 H3O+ STO-3G 空间大于默认示例。因此，公开 H3O+ 脚本采用保守的活性空间和 Trotter 设置。"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:59
msgid "Sample-Based Quantum Diagonalization"
msgstr "基于采样的量子对角化"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:61
msgid ""
"The SQD path prepares a CCSD-seeded LUCJ state in a classical ffsim simulation, samples "
"alpha/beta occupation strings, and diagonalizes the Hamiltonian in the recovered determinant "
"subspace. It reports the sampled result beside HF, active-space CCSD, same-size selected-CI and "
"random-subspace controls, and a tiered reference computed for the same Hamiltonian."
msgstr ""
"SQD 路径在经典 ffsim 模拟中制备以 CCSD 为种子的 LUCJ 态，采样 alpha/beta 占据位串，并在恢复的行列式子空间中对角化哈密顿量。它同时报告采样结果、HF、活性空间 "
"CCSD、同大小选择 CI 和随机子空间对照，以及基于同一哈密顿量的分层参考结果。"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:67
msgid ""
"The signed primary error is `1000 * (E_SQD - E_reference)` in mHa, so a positive value places SQD"
" above the reference. Only a T0 exact-active-space result supports an exact-error claim. Seed "
"spread is descriptive. It is not a confidence interval. The sampled determinant fraction also "
"does not equal simulator-memory savings because ffsim still represents the full fixed-particle-"
"number state."
msgstr ""
"主要带符号误差为 `1000 * (E_SQD - E_reference)`，单位 mHa；正值表示 SQD 高于参考能量。只有 T0 "
"活性空间内精确结果才支持精确误差声明。种子离散程度是描述性统计，不是置信区间。采样行列式比例也不等于模拟器内存节省比例，因为 ffsim 仍表示完整的固定粒子数态。"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:74
msgid ""
"The current implementation runs on a classical simulator. It integrates the algorithm and "
"scientific controls. It does not execute on quantum hardware or provide evidence of quantum "
"advantage."
msgstr "当前实现在经典模拟器上运行，集成算法及科学对照。它不在量子硬件上执行，也不提供量子优势的证据。"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:78
msgid "Phase Decoding And Energy Shifts"
msgstr "相位解码与能量平移"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:80
msgid ""
"QPE measures a phase modulo one. Large negative molecular energies can therefore produce phase "
"wrapping. When needed, q2m3 uses shifted QPE parameters to estimate a smaller energy difference "
"relative to a Hartree-Fock reference."
msgstr "QPE 测量模一相位，因此较大的负分子能量可能产生相位回绕。必要时，q2m3 使用平移后的 QPE 参数，估计相对 Hartree-Fock 参考的较小能量差。"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:85
msgid "Two phase-extraction conventions exist in the current code:"
msgstr "当前代码存在两种相位提取约定："

