msgstr "比较这些路径时，必须说明解码约定和采样模型。"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:95
msgid "RDM Measurement"
msgstr "RDM 测量"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:97
msgid ""
"The one-particle reduced density matrix (1-RDM) maps quantum-state information back into "
"classical chemical analysis. q2m3 estimates RDMs for Mulliken population analysis and charge "
"conservation checks. These estimates can support future QM/MM feedback loops."
msgstr "单粒子约化密度矩阵（1-RDM）将量子态信息传回经典化学分析。q2m3 估计 RDM，用于 Mulliken 布居分析和电荷守恒检查。这些估计也可支持未来的 QM/MM 反馈循环。"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:102
msgid ""
"RDM values must obey physical constraints such as Hermiticity, electron count, and non-negative "
"occupations. Measurement noise can violate these constraints, so the estimator includes "
"projection utilities for physically valid matrices."
msgstr "RDM 值必须满足厄米性、电子数和非负占据等物理约束。测量噪声可能破坏这些约束，因此估计器提供投影工具以获得物理有效矩阵。"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:106
msgid "Resource Estimation"
msgstr "资源估计"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:108
msgid ""
"The `q2m3.core.resource_estimation` API estimates EFTQC resources such as Hamiltonian 1-norm, "
"logical qubits, Toffoli gates, system qubits, and target error. Use these estimates to plan "
"quantum hardware resources. They are not the same as Catalyst compile memory or LLVM IR size."
msgstr ""
"`q2m3.core.resource_estimation` API 估计哈密顿量 1-范数、逻辑量子比特数、Toffoli 门数、系统量子比特数和目标误差等 EFTQC "
"资源。这些估计用于规划量子硬件资源，与 Catalyst 编译内存或 LLVM IR 大小不同。"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:113
msgid ""
"The H2 resource example demonstrates that MM point charges mainly change one-electron terms. For "
"small H2/STO-3G runs, the two-electron integrals dominate the resource estimate, so vacuum and "
"solvated estimates are close."
msgstr "H2 资源示例表明，MM 点电荷主要改变单电子项。在小规模 H2/STO-3G 运行中，双电子积分主导资源估计，因此真空和溶剂化估计接近。"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:117
msgid "Fixed-MO Full-One-Electron Embedding"
msgstr "固定分子轨道完整单电子嵌入"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:119
msgid ""
"Explicit MM point charges perturb the one-electron Hamiltonian. q2m3 exposes two public resource-"
"estimation modes for this perturbation:"
msgstr "显式 MM 点电荷扰动单电子哈密顿量。q2m3 为该扰动提供两种公开资源估计模式："

