msgid "Diagonal `Delta h_pp` terms only"
msgstr "仅包含对角 `Delta h_pp` 项"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:26
msgid "Compatibility row for dynamic coefficient-update workflows"
msgstr "与动态系数更新工作流兼容的结果行"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:26
msgid "`full_oneelectron`"
msgstr "`full_oneelectron`"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:26
msgid "Full fixed-MO `Delta h_pq` matrix"
msgstr "完整的固定分子轨道 `Delta h_pq` 矩阵"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:26
msgid "Resource rows and fixed-Hamiltonian operator support"
msgstr "资源结果行及固定哈密顿量算符支撑"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:127
msgid ""
"Both modes are fixed-MO models. They reuse the vacuum molecular-orbital frame and hold the two-"
"electron tensor at its vacuum value. They compute no orbital relaxation, polarizable MM response,"
" or relaxed solvation energy. The diagnostic `delta_h_offdiag_fro` reports the Frobenius norm of "
"the off-diagonal active-space perturbation that `diagonal` mode omits and `full_oneelectron` mode"
" includes."
msgstr ""
"两种模式均为固定分子轨道模型，复用真空分子轨道框架，并将双电子张量固定在真空值。它们不计算轨道弛豫、可极化 MM 响应或弛豫后的溶剂化能。诊断量 `delta_h_offdiag_fro` "
"报告活性空间非对角扰动的 Frobenius 范数；`diagonal` 模式忽略该扰动，`full_oneelectron` 模式包含它。"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:134
msgid "Catalyst Guidance"
msgstr "Catalyst 使用建议"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:136
msgid ""
"Catalyst is most useful when the workflow can compile once and execute many times. For a single "
"QPE execution, compilation often costs more time than it saves. MC solvation is a better fit "
"because each accepted solvent configuration can reuse the same compiled circuit structure when "
"only coefficients change at runtime."
msgstr ""
"当工作流可编译一次并多次执行时，Catalyst 最有用。对于单次 QPE 执行，编译花费的时间往往超过节省的时间。MC "
"溶剂化更适合此方式，因为仅在运行时改变系数时，每个接受的溶剂构型都可复用相同的已编译电路结构。"

