msgid ""
"q2m3 uses the difference between fixed and dynamic correlation behavior to study `delta_corr-"
"pol`, the correlation-polarization coupling term."
msgstr "q2m3 利用 fixed 与 dynamic 模式的电子相关行为差异，研究电子相关与极化耦合项 `delta_corr-pol`。"

#: ../../source/core-concepts.md:160
msgid ""
"The current dynamic runtime coefficient path updates diagonal coefficients. It does not accept "
"`embedding_mode=\"full_oneelectron\"` because off-diagonal one-electron terms can change the "
"operator support that Catalyst compiled for a given circuit."
msgstr "当前动态运行时系数路径更新对角系数。它不接受 `embedding_mode=\"full_oneelectron\"`，因为非对角单电子项可能改变 Catalyst 为给定电路编译的算符支撑。"

